option.galaxyIntensity.comment=調整銀河亮度
option.crepuscularRays=Crepuscular Rays
option.crepuscularRays.comment=Enables god rays (light shafts) visible when the sun is near the horizon through fog and clouds. Best seen at sunrise/sunset.
option.lightningFlash=閃電效果
option.lightningFlash.comment=Controls lightning flash.
option.rainbows=Rainbows
option.rainbows.comment=When enabled, a faint rainbow appears opposite the sun during and just after rain.
option.endSunEffect=終界太陽效果
